   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "76% of Americans are already worried about insurers weakening this law.\n\nCongress should investigate this coordinated campaign — and pass @RepGregMurphy (R-NC) bipartisan No Surprises Enforcement Act.",
