   "url": "https://x.com/drdanchoi/status/2088713943095370097",
   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "Make no mistake about who pays.\n\nArbitration is the only thing forcing insurers to make a fair offer. Gut it, and the cost doesn’t vanish — it comes back to patients as surprise bills, narrower networks, and less access.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-08-15T19:46:25.000Z",
   "type": "reply",
