   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "The tell:\n\nUnitedHealth reported $8B+ in quarterly earnings and touted a lower medical cost ratio — while its CEO publicly complained that arbitration awards are “egregious.”\n\nRecord profits. Still fighting to pay less.",
