   "url": "https://x.com/drdanchoi/status/2088713936485101782",
   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "Losing in court → move to the court of public opinion.\n\n• Near-identical copycat federal lawsuits from the biggest carriers\n• A wave of op-eds blaming doctors\n• A brand-new “coalition” with a six-figure ad buy to kill the bipartisan No Surprises Enforcement Act",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-08-15T19:46:23.000Z",
   "type": "reply",
   "author": {
    "id": "944821373750403072",
