   "url": "https://x.com/drdanchoi/status/2088713933670797706",
   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "That was the THIRD dismissal of insurer lawsuits against the same billing intermediary — California, Texas, now Georgia.\n\nThey also lost when the administration finalized new arbitration rules in May. They sued over that too.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-08-15T19:46:22.000Z",
   "type": "reply",
