   "url": "https://x.com/drdanchoi/status/2088713931401707580",
   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "Why do they lose so badly?\n\nIn arbitration, both sides submit a number. Insurers routinely submit zero — or an offer so low it wouldn’t cover cab fare.\n\nA federal judge in Georgia said it’s far more plausible the insurer is lowballing to maximize profit than that thousands of doctors are conspiring.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-08-15T19:46:22.000Z",
   "type": "reply",
   "author": {
    "id": "944821373750403072",
