   "url": "https://x.com/drdanchoi/status/2088713928687894936",
   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "So why the assault?\n\nBecause insurers lose ~88% of arbitration cases reviewing the payment offers they make.\n\nWhen a neutral third party looks at the numbers, the insurers are wrong almost 9 times out of 10.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-08-15T19:46:21.000Z",
   "type": "reply",
