   "url": "https://x.com/drdanchoi/status/2088713926041305251",
   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "The law works.\n\nBefore it passed:\n• ~41% of Americans had gotten a surprise out-of-network bill\n• Nearly 1 in 5 ER visits ended in one\n\nCBO’s own conclusion: the No Surprises Act is protecting patients. For some services, inflation-adjusted prices have gone DOWN.",
