   "conversationId": "2088713923973533937",
   "text": "Insurers are running a coordinated campaign to destroy the No Surprises Act — the law that stopped Americans from getting $100,000 surprise medical bills.\n\nThey’re losing in court. So they’re going after the law itself.\n\nHere’s what’s actually happening 🧵",
