   "text": "We’re hiring a Chief Operating Officer (COO) 🚀\n\nSpine Medicine and Surgery of Long Island is a fully independent, physician-led spine practice that scaled to 5 physicians in under 5 years and is now expanding rapidly across the tri-state area.\n\nLooking for a healthcare operator who thrives in a fast-paced, startup-style environment and is tech-forward—with experience using AI, automation, and data to improve operations and patient experience.\n\nFull-time | On-site | Ronkonkoma, NY\n\nhttps://spinemedicineandsurgeryoflongisland.applytojob.com/apply/GaK6eFp2jb/Chief-Operating-Officer-COO-Spine-Surgery-Practice\n\n#HealthcareLeadership #COO #IndependentMedicine #AIinHealthcare #HealthcareJobs",
